<title>HONG KONG: Asia Securities 1996 net rises 22.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Asia Securities 1996 net rises 22.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.98	vs  2.55 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.47 loss vs  9.54 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    20.50     vs  16.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		    554.68     vs 246.62</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asia Securities International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 16-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Asia Securities engages in property investment and development, investment holding, underwriting and securities trading.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-10 shares held.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$23.47 million on securities trading, gain of HK$9.54 million write back of deficit on revaluation of investment properties and gain of HK$9.46 million on disposal of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted to take into account the effect of a rights issue which tool place during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
